# Glider Staff {2}{W}: "When this Equipment enters, airbend up to one target creature." (CR 701.65a), "Equipped creature gets +1/+1
# and has flying", "Equip {2}". Turn 3: Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet pay for the Staff and its trigger airbends Bot2's
# Ornithopter (any creature may be the target, the trigger asks since there are two); the Staff does not attach itself. Then two
# Plains pay Equip {2} onto Bot1's Memnite: a 2/2 with flying, where the unequipped Memnite is a 1/1 without it.

